  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The tutorial world which shows new players how to get used to the controls doesn't show you how to enter safe mode. I think it would be great to show the player how to enter it with visible button prompts, and also to see if the player is able to pull it off.\nMore often than not, a new player will have a bad experience before remembering or figuring out that safe mode exists. The safe mode button in the menu is not visible enough to attract people's attention, so it's better to educate players how to use the button combo to activate it.",
